\[
\begin{pmatrix} x \\ y \end{pmatrix}
=
\begin{pmatrix} 8 \\ -1 \end{pmatrix}
+
t\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}
\]

So \(x=8+2t\) and \(y=-1+3t\). Eliminate \(t\):

\[
t=\frac{x-8}{2}
\]

\[
y=-1+3\left(\frac{x-8}{2}\right)
= -1+\frac{3x-24}{2}
= \frac{3x}{2}-13
\]

Thus \(m=\frac32\) and \(b=-13\).

\[
\boxed{\left(\frac32, -13\right)}
\]
